  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\n**Given statement :** 95 * 5 + 19 ÷ 2 − 21 = 36\n\n**According to the question, after interchanging the signs:**\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷ and *​\n\nGiven statement : 95 * 5 + 19 ÷ 2 − 21 = 36\n\n**95 ÷ 5**__ + 19 × 2 − 21 = 36\n\n19 + __**19 × 2**__ − 21 = 36\n\n__**19 + 38**__ - 21 = 36\n\n__**57 - 21**__ = 36\n\n**36 = 36 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : + and -\n\nGiven statement : 95 * 5 + 19 ÷ 2 − 21 = 36\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n95 × 5 - **19 ÷ 2**__ + 21 = 36\n\n__**95 × 5**__ - 9.5 + 21 = 36\n\n__**475 + 21**__ - 9.5 = 36\n\n__**496 - 9.5**__ = 36\n\n486.5 ≠ 36 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ and −\n\nGiven statement : 95 * 5 + 19 ÷ 2 − 21 = 36\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n95 × 5 + 19 - **2 ÷ 21**__ = 36\n\n__**95 × 5**__ + 19 - 0.095 = 36\n\n__**475 + 19**__ - 0.095 = 36\n\n__**494 - 0.095**__ = 36\n\n493.9 ≠ 36 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : + and *\n\nGiven statement : 95 * 5 + 19 ÷ 2 − 21 = 36\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n95 + 5 × **19 ÷ 2**__ − 21 = 36\n\n95 + __**5 × 7.5**__ - 21 = 36\n\n__**95 + 37.5**__ - 21 = 36\n\n__**132.5 - 21**__ = 36\n\n111.5 ≠ 36 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
